WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:06.157
- Everyone has a problem with time.

00:00:06.157 --> 00:00:09.657
But, the day is 24 hours and we sleep six.

00:00:11.905 --> 00:00:13.597
Now I know there are
some out there that say

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:16.207
oh woah, woah, woah, woah, I need eight.

00:00:16.207 --> 00:00:18.405
Well I say, just sleep a little faster.

00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:21.818
I went to school, I was
working in construction,

00:00:21.818 --> 00:00:24.232
I was working out my five hours a day,

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.669
I was taking acting classes

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:28.123
from eight o'clock at
night to 12 midnight.

00:00:28.123 --> 00:00:30.755
I was doing all of those things.

00:00:30.755 --> 00:00:35.135
I wanted to make sure that
out of the 24 hours of the day

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:37.966
that I don't waste one single hour.

00:00:37.966 --> 00:00:39.529
Those hours were too precious.

00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:41.030
And so then I just want to tell people,

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.432
don't give me this thing,
I have a difficult time

00:00:43.432 --> 00:00:46.041
with the time, and I don't have
time for this, none of that.

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:49.184
You have time, you make the time.

00:00:49.184 --> 00:00:51.767
(heroic music)

